                                                "sense_id": "bef586db-1779-3063-a1c6-eb47322d75f1",
                                                "text": "Thirteen years later, a variety of causes, some of which will be unfolded in the course of this narrative, had contributed to irritate the impatience of the nation, while the unskillfulness of the existing minister had disarmed the royal authority."
                                            }
                                        ]
